# Common: Docker Compose and Kubernetes
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Excalidraw has no persistent server-side data, no DB, and no configurable
# env vars of its own — this file exists only so the service follows the same
# cp .env.example .env convention as every other service. Nothing to fill in.

